{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01282","headline":"相和歌辞 怨诗二首 二 · 薛奇童","name":"相和歌辞 怨诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁苑春风起，流莺绕合欢。\n玉窗通日气，珠箔卷轻寒。\n杨叶垂金砌，梨花入井阑。\n君王好长袖，新作舞衣宽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛奇童","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}